    {"name": "Financial Health", "score": 15, "max_score": 20, "rationale": "Strong liquidity (5.25x current ratio, $5.17B cash) and moderate leverage (0.76 D/E) offset by volatile OCF ($1.66B→-$2.49B YoY) indicating working capital volatility typical of cyclical hardware businesses."},
