    {"name": "Momentum", "score": 14, "max_score": 20, "rationale": "Strong recent growth and AI tailwind support momentum, but deteriorating profitability trends (NM 9%→4.8%, OM 10.7%→5.7%) and recent debt increase suggest operational leverage challenges entering new quarter."}
