    {
      "finding": "Free cash flow turned deeply negative in Q3 (FCF -$6.70B) and has been negative for three of the last four quarters, undermining any earnings-based bull narrative and making the DCF intrinsic value calculation produce a negative output.",
      "evidence": "[Source: FMP /cash-flow-statement] — Q3 OCF -$6.62B, Q2 OCF -$0.02B, Q1 OCF -$0.92B; DCF intrinsic value -$60.37"
    },
    {
      "finding": "Gross margins have compressed dramatically and erratically — from 13.1% two years ago to 6.3% in Q2 and recovering partially to 9.9% in Q3 — suggesting either severe pricing pressure, product mix deterioration, or one-time cost dislocations that the market has not reconciled.",
      "evidence": "[Source: FMP /income-statement] — GM trajectory: 13.1% → 11.8% → 9.6% → 9.5% → 9.3% → 6.3% → 9.9% over 8 quarters"
    },
    {
      "finding": "Institutional holder count declined by 46 entities QoQ with 144 positions fully closed against only 106 new entrants, and two large mystery positions (CIK 0002100119/0002100121 together ~62.5M shares) were opened simultaneously — raising questions about the nature and longevity of these holdings.",
